BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beat Corridor Improv Jam Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260506T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260507T000000
UID:3461a1b40e5fefb57b66a04de389f746@bossadc.com
DESCRIPTION:Beat Corridor (formerly Shining Blade/SoulDown Sessions) is a 
 space for DC musicians who like funk\, soul\, and hip hop to meet\, create
 \, and/or simply vibe together in an informal jam session. Beat Corridor i
 s hosted by local band Shining Blade Theory and occurs every Wednesday.
LOCATION:Downstairs\, Bossa Bistro + Lounge\, 2463 18th Street NW\, Washin
 gton\, DC 20009
URL:https://bossadc.com/events/beat-corridor/
X-SOURCE:Bossa Bistro + Lounge
END:VEVENT
